/P 85 0 R
/E (Combining refractive, biometric, and structural parameters offers an opportunity to study SANS-related visual changes comprehensively, detect potential abnormalities before they worsen, support vision rehabilitation, and provide medical personnel with useful information for decision-making during long-duration space missions.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [3]
>>
