343 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 85 0 R
/E (Beyond its initial application to SANS monitoring, this platform has the potential to expand the field of astronaut health monitoring across multiple medical domains by leveraging the collection, integration, and longitudinal analysis of biomarkers, combined with machine learning techniques. These capabilities could enable the identification of complex patterns, early detection of physiological changes, and prediction of health risks associated with different medical conditions, establishing a scalable framework for more comprehensive, predictive, and personalized health monitoring in space.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
